The audit fixes of the gate, review_change and the records state their new facts beside the paragraphs they correct: `commit_reviewed(reviewers=…, reason=…)` composes the commit panel through review_change's composer and the reviewed stage cycle runs under the composed pool (decision 1A); a composed panel counts marked pool rows only and an enabled row outside the pool is an added critic; a documentation-only diff pays the tests preflight like any other; the system record names the chosen row's real seat plan, binds the tree snapshotted before the reviewer reads and carries the call's own ask (goal, author questions, reason); the checkout's newest preflight look is the look `review_status` reports and a later worktree mutation stales it with its editor named; and the public brief builder renders, byte for byte, the brief a wave's seat is sent through the one owner each for the author's questions and the history with open obligations.
